cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its write-ups, please cite it as below. Code is MIT; prose is CC BY 4.0."
type: software
title: "Ancient algorithms, implemented"
abstract: >-
  Python implementations of algorithms from dated historical sources:
  Aryabhata's kuttaka, tested against the worked examples in Bhaskara I's
  commentary; Madhava's series for pi with its end corrections; and the square
  root of 2 on the Babylonian tablet YBC 7289.
authors:
  - family-names: Subrahmanya
    given-names: Prasad
    website: "https://prasad.tech"
version: 0.1.0
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
